# Local screenshots
redesign-*.png

# The paid deliverables — the Pro zips and the Pro licence — never belong in this
# public repo.
#
# `templates/*/images/pro/` used to be ignored alongside them (2026-08-27, #18).
# That was wrong and it broke the demos: build-one-template.sh deploys the PRO
# build as the live demo on purpose, so the demo pages reference images/pro/*
# and every one of them 404'd across 34 templates. The photographs are demo
# content, not the paid differentiator — what people buy is the template source
# and the licence, both of which are still excluded below.
# Reinstated 2026-08-30 at Allan's direction after the breakage was found.
**/LICENSE-PRO.md
*-pro-static.zip
*-pro-source.zip

# Local social-card working file, never deployed
fb-cards.html
fb-cards/

# Pro workbook builds are parked outside the public site until they ship to Gumroad.
# See the free-kits-and-pro-holding-pattern memory. Nothing here should ever be committed.
spreadsheets/pro-pending/
**/pro-pending/

# local screenshot helpers (session tooling)
redesign/shot*.mjs
data/ph-typhoon/_build/.cache/
